        // In Jackson's NumberSerializer, visitIntFormat internally calls visitor.expectIntFormat(typeHint)
        // or similar depending on the specific implementation of the visitor.
        // Based on the provided snippet, we verify the logic leads to the BIG_INTEGER path.

        // Note: Since visitIntFormat is a protected method in the real class, 
        // we verify the side effect on the visitor.
        verify(visitor).expectIntFormat(typeHint);
